{"id":"tornozelo","lemma":"tornozelo","pos":"noun","rank":3498,"glosses":["ankle (each of the bony protrusions (external and internal) that are found in the region of the joint between the leg and the foot)"],"ipa":"/tuɾ.nuˈze.lu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tornozelos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Wiktionairy-tornozelo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tenho um tornozelo inchado.","en":"I have a swollen ankle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/535827","words":[{"g":"have","l":"ter"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to swell","l":"inchar"}]},{"text":"O que aconteceu com o seu tornozelo?","en":"What happened to your ankle?","words":[null,null,{"g":"to happen","l":"acontecer"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"his"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Meus tornozelos, frequentemente, ficam inchados.","en":"My ankles often become swollen.","words":[{"g":"my kin"},null,{"g":"frequently, often"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},null]},{"text":"Ele torceu o tornozelo.","en":"He sprained his ankle.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to twist","l":"torcer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Eu torci o tornozelo.","en":"I twisted my ankle.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to twist","l":"torcer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}